; Everything in one file.
; Syntax: https://hledger.org/hledger.html#journal

; Optional declarations - uncomment these to make reports and https://hledger.org/hledger.html#check work better.
;
; ; COMMODITIES
; ; https://hledger.org/hledger.html#commodity-directive
;
; commodity $1000.00
; commodity 1000.00 EUR
; ;commodity 1 000 000,00 EUR   ; https://hledger.org/hledger.html#commodity-display-style can be customised
; ; A lots: tag enables lots and capital gains tracking.
; commodity 1. AAPL         ; lots:
; commodity 1.000000 ADA    ; lots:
; commodity 1.00000000 BTC  ; lots:
;
; ; ACCOUNTS
; ; https://hledger.org/hledger.html#account-directive
; ; The order of declarations also sets https://hledger.org/hledger.html#account-display-order.
; ; Lower case, unspaced account names are easiest to type, but use capitals/spaces if you prefer.
; ; https://hledger.org/hledger.html#account-names
;
; ; Top-level accounts and their https://hledger.org/hledger.html#account-types.
; account assets       ; type:A
; account liabilities  ; type:L
; account equity       ; type:E
; account revenues     ; type:R
; account expenses     ; type:X
;
; ; Subaccounts/subcategories.
; account assets:bank:checking
; account assets:cash
; account assets:receivable
;
; account liabilities:bank:credit card
; account liabilities:payable
;
; account equity:start
; account equity:conversion
;
; account revenues:gifts
; account revenues:salary
; account revenues:consulting
; account revenues:gains
;
; account expenses:food
; account expenses:gifts
; account expenses:home
; account expenses:misc
; account expenses:online services
; account expenses:personal care
; account expenses:phone
; account expenses:recreation
; account expenses:transport
; account expenses:travel
; account expenses:utilities


; Opening balances. 
; Pick a start date for this journal, name some asset and liability accounts
; that you'll keep track of, and record their balances at the start of this day.

2026-01-01 opening balances
    assets:bank:checking                       $1000
    assets:cash                                 $100
    liabilities:bank:credit card                $-50.12
    equity:start

; Transactions. 
; Keeping them in date order allows extra error checking (hledger check ordereddates).

2026-01-02 received wages
    revenues:salary
    assets:bank:checking                       $1000

2026-01-03 Whole Foods | bought groceries
    assets:cash
    expenses:food                                $50

